        "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/2e88ef09521ffd6c7bb7cc9e32daa8d3.avif?t=1787796634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras_big/2e88ef09521ffd6c7bb7cc9e32daa8d3.webp?t=1787796634 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delta 78: The Passenger </strong>is a pixel art narrative experience set aboard a drifting spaceship. You play as Miller, a crew member who wakes up disoriented and alone — in a place where everything seems dead... except for something watching from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the silent corridors, investigate old terminals, and uncover what happened to the missing crew. Featuring a choice-based internal monologue system, every interaction might reveal the truth — or lead to your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/bb9cbfcf1db03b118632e437a3d6d846.poster.avif?t=1787796634\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/bb9cbfcf1db03b118632e437a3d6d846.webm?t=1787796634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/bb9cbfcf1db03b118632e437a3d6d846.mp4?t=1787796634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative with interactive dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, pixelated visual style inspired by sci-fi horror classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for those who enjoy introspective and tense games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/2e88ef09521ffd6c7bb7cc9e32daa8d3.avif?t=1787796634\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras_big/2e88ef09521ffd6c7bb7cc9e32daa8d3.webp?t=1787796634 width=1560 height=1170 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Delta 78: The Passenger </strong>is a pixel art narrative experience set aboard a drifting spaceship. You play as Miller, a crew member who wakes up disoriented and alone — in a place where everything seems dead... except for something watching from the darkness.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore the silent corridors, investigate old terminals, and uncover what happened to the missing crew. Featuring a choice-based internal monologue system, every interaction might reveal the truth — or lead to your downfall.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/bb9cbfcf1db03b118632e437a3d6d846.poster.avif?t=1787796634\" width=608 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/bb9cbfcf1db03b118632e437a3d6d846.webm?t=1787796634\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3715880/extras/bb9cbfcf1db03b118632e437a3d6d846.mp4?t=1787796634\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Narrative with interactive dialogue.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dark, pixelated visual style inspired by sci-fi horror classics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Immersive setting.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ideal for those who enjoy introspective and tense games.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
        "short_description": "A crew member wakes up alone on a silent ship. Something is wrong. Something is watching. Delta 78: The Passenger is a dark sci-fi experience with interactive storytelling and stealth gameplay.",
